audio, what usage rights a creator has from AI-generated music, and whether a perfect soundtrack is now one click away.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T15:40:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T16:00:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"5635927d-b7a7-4537-9720-6746e34bbab8","name":"Stage 3","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"5fde0295-86c0-4298-8eaf-fe7559ac1278","name":"Joey Reed","company_name":"Joey Reed","job_title":"Creator","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/b6ml3kkcbjz2z16fivkzv7lfj413?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/b6ml3kkcbjz2z16fivkzv7lfj413?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/b6ml3kkcbjz2z16fivkzv7lfj413?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/b6ml3kkcbjz2z16fivkzv7lfj413?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/b6ml3kkcbjz2z16fivkzv7lfj413?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"efa98fe4-cd5e-4230-82db-9900419d554e","name":"Keli Li","company_name":"Sonilo","job_title":"Co-founder & COO","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/vgmmh0d2ji0iifnbubva6zs77bsh?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/vgmmh0d2ji0iifnbubva6zs77bsh?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/vgmmh0d2ji0iifnbubva6zs77bsh?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/vgmmh0d2ji0iifnbubva6zs77bsh?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/vgmmh0d2ji0iifnbubva6zs77bsh?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}}],"conferenceSlug":"lis26","schedule_track":{"id":"","name":"Creative Summit","description":"","custom_order":0},"languages":[],"translations":{},"livevoice_url":null},{"id":"843aa874-521d-432d-a019-8f4009bbd30b","slug":"decoding-planet-earth","title":"Decoding planet Earth","description":"Current AI models excel at predicting words, but understanding physical events in real time is a whole different challenge. The next AI frontier will be to teach machines how to perceive physical environments as they change. Developers will get a clear look at how systems ingest real-world signals, from live news and geodata to visual inputs, to better understand the world around us.","date":"November 12","starts_at":"2026-11-12T15:45:00Z","ends_at":"2026-11-12T16:05:00Z","duration":"","location":{"id":"685b779a-20e7-4280-b402-b239764fb6d6","name":"Stage 10","venue":""},"timeslot_participations":[{"id":"","attendance_id":"5a1454c2-bc51-4fdf-aedc-bafafd80659e","name":"Kalev Leetaru","company_name":"GDELT","job_title":"Founder","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=100&h=100","medium":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=300&h=300","large":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=600&h=600","original":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/3kzr7ns8hpghnnny44m00dtevcoo?ixlib=rails-4.3.1"}},{"id":"","attendance_id":"a29370c6-5906-4b3c-b93e-41755f81e3bd","name":"Dustin Tran","company_name":"Elorian","job_title":"Chief Reasoning Architect","role":"","avatar_urls":{"tiny":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/9yabfb2x932k5waj384rnhnyhc1q?ixlib=rails-4.3.1&auto=format&fit=crop&crop=faces&w=48&h=48","thumb":"https://web-summit-engine.imgix.net/9yabfb2x9